{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Tesla/status/2124222447855743019","id":"2124222447855743019","text":"FSD v15 now starting to roll out – upgrading every part of the end-to-end driving network \n\nSafety\n25x better handling of safety critical cases\n\nTesla Reality View \nAdds a live visualization of the drive that lets you see & control what FSD is planning to do\n\nNavigation for start & end of the trip now learns end-to-end from fleet route preferences. Later v15 releases will expand this to the entire route.\n\nYou also should notice better detection of signs, animals, debris, potholes and standing water, plus more natural speed handling in school zones and inclement weather.\n\nLastly, FSD can now slow for speed cameras & Bike Rack Mode lets you enable FSD w/ bike racks or similar hitch accessories","raw_text":{"text":"FSD v15 now starting to roll out – upgrading every part of the end-to-end driving network \n\nSafety\n25x better handling of safety critical cases\n\nTesla Reality View \nAdds a live visualization of the drive that lets you see & control what FSD is planning to do\n\nNavigation for start & end of the trip now learns end-to-end from fleet route preferences. Later v15 releases will expand this to the entire route.\n\nYou also should notice better detection of signs, animals, debris, potholes and standing water, plus more natural speed handling in school zones and inclement weather.\n\nLastly, FSD can now slow for speed cameras & Bike Rack Mode lets you enable FSD w/ bike racks or similar hitch accessories","display_text_range":[0,700],"facets":[{"type":"bold","indices":[0,33]},{"type":"bold","indices":[92,99]},{"type":"bold","indices":[145,165]},{"type":"bold","indices":[260,270]},{"type":"media","indices":[285,308],"id":"2124221674111512576","display":"pic.x.com/Sfjk4wZecW","original":"https://t.co/Sfjk4wZecW","replacement":"https://x.com/Tesla/status/2124222447855743019/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Tesla","url":"ht